            "target_zero_based_slice": [
              409,
              413
            ],
            "before": "package tests, lint, and notebook source replay are executed by the dated review\r\nreceipt [included in this package](docs/preprint_review_validation_2026_10_02.json);\r\nit lists the commands, tool versions, exit statuses, tested source hashes,\r\nand any skips. The [publication review](docs/preprint_review_2026_10_02.md)\r\nstates the readiness judgment and evidence limits. Historical receipts in\r\nthis package keep their original dates and scope and are not current\r\nexecution evidence.\r\n",
            "after": "package tests, lint, and notebook replay are executed by the dated review\r\nreceipt recorded with this revision; that receipt lists each command, tool\r\nversion, exit status, and tested scope. Historical receipts in this package\r\nkeep their original dates and scope and are not current execution evidence.\r\n"
