        ]
      ],
      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Complete 231-line rendered claim ledger, all 26 rows and withdrawn/excluded sections, read. It explicitly withdraws the 28-run detector-performance narrative and the claim that recomputed unauthenticated hashes resist forgery; it distinguishes canonical host, package illustration, historical fixes and proposed efficacy study. However P3-20 compresses the diagnostic reachability lemma incorrectly: presence disagreement with a high/critical defect alone refuses rather than diagnosing (PUB-F02). Evidence counts and test names are retained assertions, not fresh execution.",
