      ],
      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Complete 64-line source ledger read. It separates source inspection, illustrative package tests, missing route ports, phrase-list examples, unexecuted study, finite arithmetic lemmas and inactive anti-skill records. It preserves withdrawal of scripted/model mixed evidence and digest-authentication overclaims. P3-20 has the same too-broad presence-disagreement shorthand as the rendered ledger; the manuscript contains the correct severity-qualified iff.",
      "source_evidence": [
