      "review_level": "full_body_via_prior_pinned_read_complete_equal_ranges_and_delta_review",
      "assessment": "Full 838-line historical source body assessed via the pinned prior full primary manuscript read, every unchanged raw interval and all 32 complete changed/deleted intervals, plus fresh full linked manuscript and ledger reading. It predates the later 0.2.0 primary source: omitted material includes explicit source-pin roles, decision-table/budget boundaries, exact false-suppression denominator and multiplicity language, signal-versus-statistical independence, positive-entry-versus-distinct-agent caveat, universal-panel quantifier clarification and the later scoped failure-memory extension. Those deltas were all read, not classified merely by similarity. Its underlying finite lemmas remain useful under the stated hypotheses; its missing route seam and historical corrections do not assert present deployment or efficacy.",
